<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 96 0 R
/T (To applythe main techniques of feature engineering - data understanding, cleaning, missing-value handling, visualisation, encoding of categorical attributes, scaling, text vectorisation, feature construction, transformation, outlier capping, dimensionality reduction and feature selection - to the message dataset of the ScamLens AI project \(an explainable scam and phishing detection system\), so that raw SMS / e-mail / offer messages become a completely numerical, informative and model-ready dataset. )
/E (To applythe main techniques of feature engineering - data understanding, cleaning, missing-value handling, visualisation, encoding of categorical attributes, scaling, text vectorisation, feature construction, transformation, outlier capping, dimensionality reduction and feature selection - to the message dataset of the ScamLens AI project \(an explainable scam and phishing detection system\), so that raw SMS / e-mail / offer messages become a completely numerical, informative and model-ready dataset. )
/Pg 10 0 R
