127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 96 0 R
/T (Feature engineering is the workofturning raw records into the input variables \(features\) that a machine-learning model learns from, using knowledgeofthe problem. A scam message is only a string of characters; no classifier can read it directly. Good featuresexposethe real signal - for example "the message is urgent, asks for an OTP and contains a link on a .top domain"-sothat even a simple modelcan find the pattern, while poor features hide the signal from the best algorithm.Intextprojects it usually decidesthe result more than the choice of model. )
/E (Feature engineering is the workofturning raw records into the input variables \(features\) that a machine-learning model learns from, using knowledgeofthe problem. A scam message is only a string of characters; no classifier can read it directly. Good featuresexposethe real signal - for example "the message is urgent, asks for an OTP and contains a link on a .top domain"-sothat even a simple modelcan find the pattern, while poor features hide the signal from the best algorithm.Intextprojects it usually decidesthe result more than the choice of model. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
