/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 101 0 R
/T (Because the data has no gaps, 10 % of n_words was hidden on purpose and four imputers tried to recover it. KNN is far better \(MAE 0.82\) than mean \(4.94\), median \(4.95\) and mode \(5.44\), because n_words is correlated with n_special \(0.70\) and n_chars \(0.61\), and KNN uses those neighbours while the other three ignore them. Mean and median would win on a skewed count column that has no correlated partners, so the technique must be chosen from the data - not by habit. )
/E (Because the data has no gaps, 10 % of n_words was hidden on purpose and four imputers tried to recover it. KNN is far better \(MAE 0.82\) than mean \(4.94\), median \(4.95\) and mode \(5.44\), because n_words is correlated with n_special \(0.70\) and n_chars \(0.61\), and KNN uses those neighbours while the other three ignore them. Mean and median would win on a skewed count column that has no correlated partners, so the technique must be chosen from the data - not by habit. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [64]
>>
