1368 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 112 0 R
/T (Two components explain only 50.1 % of the variance\(34.2 % + 15.9 %\), so PCA compresses these ten columns only moderately. PCA_1 is loaded by url_risk_max \(0.42\), n_words \(0.40\), lex_total \(0.40\) and has_url \(0.39\) - a 'scam-signal intensity' axis - andPCA_2 mainly by n_digits \(0.65\) and bait_score. K-Means found four groups without seeing the label.Cluster 0 \(729 messages\) is 100 % scam, with a mean URL risk of 0.71 and 4.8 lexicon hits; cluster 2 \(680 messages\) is only 32.6 % scam and has almost no URL risk. This works as a behaviour feature, but the perfect purityofcluster 0 reflects how clean the synthetic templates are. )
/E (Two components explain only 50.1 % of the variance\(34.2 % + 15.9 %\), so PCA compresses these ten columns only moderately. PCA_1 is loaded by url_risk_max \(0.42\), n_words \(0.40\), lex_total \(0.40\) and has_url \(0.39\) - a 'scam-signal intensity' axis - andPCA_2 mainly by n_digits \(0.65\) and bait_score. K-Means found four groups without seeing the label.Cluster 0 \(729 messages\) is 100 % scam, with a mean URL risk of 0.71 and 4.8 lexicon hits; cluster 2 \(680 messages\) is only 32.6 % scam and has almost no URL risk. This works as a behaviour feature, but the perfect purityofcluster 0 reflects how clean the synthetic templates are. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
