1986 0 obj
<<
/Title (A quickDecision Tree and a Logistic Regression are trained on the final features to confirm that the dataset is usable. The splitis done by message template, exactly like the project's own training, so near-duplicates cannot leak across it. Themodels themselves are not the aim of this assignment.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1674 0 R
/First 2272 0 R
/Last 2273 0 R
/Count -3
/Next 1987 0 R
>>
endobj
1987 0 obj
<<
/Title (The pipeline works end to end: both models train on the engineered columns without anyfurtherconversion. Logistic Regression reaches an F1 of 0.99 and the depth-6 tree 0.95 \(scam precision 1.00, recall0.90\), and the tree relies mostly on lex_total \(0.85\).)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1674 0 R
/Prev 1986 0 R
/First 2274 0 R
/Last 2275 0 R
/Count -3
>>
endobj
