3009 0 obj
<<
/Title (Scams hit the urgency, threat, prize, verify and action lexicons far more often, but legitimate messages also contain money and sensitive words \(bank alerts, bill reminders\), so a single lexicon count is not enough on its own. upper_ratio has a long right tail, yet an all-capitals message can be legitimate \(a friend writing in capitals\), so capitals alone are not a scam signal. The heatmapshows that the strongest links are between closely related columns \(for example has_url and url_risk_max,0.79\); the other correlations are moderate.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3001 0 R
/Prev 3015 0 R
>>
endobj
